  "Calm": "Calme",
  "A calm game, made calmly": "Un jeu calme, créé calmement",
  "We make a puzzle with no clock, and we try to work the same way: steady weeks, honest planning, no crunch culture.": "Nous créons un puzzle sans horloge et essayons de travailler pareil : semaines régulières, planification honnête, sans culture de surmenage.",
