  "Contact the OutBrick team about game support, bugs, accessibility, privacy, purchases, press, partnerships, affiliates or careers. A person replies.": "Contactez l’équipe OutBrick pour assistance, bugs, accessibilité, confidentialité, achats, presse, partenariats, affiliation ou carrières. Une personne répond.",
